    "message": "fix: re-pin the Connect demo to the commit that ships the showcase app (#166)\n\ndemo/posit-connect/app.R runs system.file(\"showcase\", \"igvShinyDemo.R\") out\nof the installed package, but the manifest still pinned 559c5c8 (1.9.35), which\npredates the move of the flagship demo into inst/showcase/ in #165. Connect\ndeployed the new app.R against the old package, system.file() returned \"\", and\nthe guard stopped the app at startup - the \"Runtime error\" publish failure.\n\nRe-pinned to 4b1389d (1.9.41), which also refreshes the stale app.R and\nREADME.md checksums.",
    "time": 1785599751
